   "id": "math.definite-integral",
   "name": "The definite integral",
   "requires": [
    "math.riemann-sum"
   ],
   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "If n grows without limit, Δx → 0 and the Riemann sums approach the exact area. That exact area is the definite integral ∫ from a to b of f(x) dx. For a straight-line graph you can get it from a triangle or trapezoid."
    },
    "am": {
     "text": "n ያለገደብ ሲያድግ Δx → 0 ይሆናል፤ የሪማን ድምሮች ትክክለኛውን ስፋት ይቀርባሉ። ይህ ስፋት ዴፊኒት ኢንቲግራል ነው።",
     "machine": true
    }
   },
